  "body": "The frozen replacement SDK and original Panda1.10.13 wheel compile different offsets for the same GLGraphicsStateGuardian members: version major0x618 versus0x688, minor0x61c versus0x68c, vendor0x600 versus0x670 (112-byte difference). This DATA-only audit establishes a concrete member-layout incompatibility and a layout-sensitive Cg configuration difference. It does not establish the exact cause/call site of the prior consumed SIGABRT or claim a fix.\n\nSDK HAVE_CG is undefined; original wheel links Cg/CgGL and its ShaderCaps::clear initializes Cg fields through byte31. SDK no-Cg ShaderCaps contains only a bool. Same-source SDK-build clear is4bytes versus installed-wheel36bytes; that build provider is inspected as DATA and never installed/loaded. Complete wheel flags and Cg-only reconciliation remain unproven.\n\nSame upstream commit470e352 is reconstructed from wheel constant-return data. Selected vtables have matching40/88/1024byte sizes and125named agreements/zero named disagreements;13other entries unresolved/constants. Selected TypeRegistry state/functions are SDK imports with pinned wheel dtool definitions. These checks do not qualify runtime resolution or full object ABI. Compiler versions14.2/10.2 and --no-python are not independently diagnosed as causal.\n\n34input identities verified; selected wheel matches retained publisher SHA/size and ZIP CRC/RECORD, image core/currentSDK/four Panda providers match authenticated inventory, ten SDK headers match recorded build inputs. Evidence: docs/evidence/panda-object-abi-audit-01/audit.json, disassembly, source excerpts, vtables and non-production analysis recipes. Original comparator binaries stay output-only. Result: docs/STAGE7_PANDA_OBJECT_ABI_AUDIT_RESULT.md.\n\nDocs/evidence-only branch against unchanged feature/panda-real-glx-canary-v1/84e9128. Preserve7035basefiles/modes,299pins,10originals,main,Drafts102\u2013120,native8/image3/mapping01/dispatch01/onefailedrealGLX01 and260sourceclosure. No new native run/load/build, request activation, retry, image replacement, Cloudregistry publication, main/shared-base update or merge. Existing failure/defaultoffM1proof unchanged. Scientificallowance0/strict0of4FAIL/Stage7INCOMPLETE.\n\nFinal exactHEAD CI(push+PR,fourjobs,attempt1,artifacts0), body roundtrip, fresh preservation and clean-tree evidence is written postcommit to output/stage7-panda-object-abi-audit-01/final-verification.json. No success or native repair is inferred from static findings.\n",
